    <node id="&quot;2023&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"2023 is the year in which the agreement about high stakes is made, providing a temporal context."&lt;SEP&gt;"The year the European Commission plans to review the Data Retention Directive, indicating future actions."</data>
